## Original Content
Le projet de complexe de loisirs incluant trois parcs à thème à Cergy-Pontoise (Val-d’Oise), annoncé par Emmanuel Macron lundi à l’occasion de la venue à Paris du prince héritier saoudien, est porté par cette entreprise publique, filiale du fonds souverain saoudien.

## Summary
The Qiddiya Investment Company, a Saudi public company, is leading a project to build a leisure complex with three theme parks in Cergy-Pontoise, France. The project was announced by French President Emmanuel Macron during the visit of the Saudi crown prince to Paris.

## Key Points
- A leisure complex with three theme parks is planned for Cergy-Pontoise, Val-d’Oise, France.
- The project is led by Qiddiya Investment Company, a Saudi public entity.
- The announcement was made by President Emmanuel Macron during the Saudi crown prince's visit.
- Qiddiya Investment Company is a subsidiary of the Saudi sovereign wealth fund.


